values, or trading records. Everything under data/ is code that describes a
schema and a fetch procedure.

Data consumed by this project comes from a vendor (xtdata / the QMT terminal)
under terms agreed between the user and that vendor. Those terms are not
granted, and cannot be granted, by this repository's MIT license.

If a sample dataset is ever added, its source and terms MUST be recorded in
data/README.md before it is committed.

